 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "钓鱼签名，是诱导你签下一个授权，把资产的控制权交给攻击者。",
   "spoken": "钓鱼签名，是诱导你签下一个授权，把资产的控制权交给攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 9.614
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "你签的是真名，私钥也一直在你手里。",
   "spoken": "你签的是真名，私钥也一直在你手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.68,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 10.778,
   "speechEnd": 13.409
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "打个比方，骗子拿来一张快递签收单，请你签个字。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，骗子拿来一张快递签收单，请你签个字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.452,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 14.55,
   "speechEnd": 18.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "签收单背面印着，同意把房门钥匙交给持单人。",
   "spoken": "签收单背面印着，同意把房门钥匙交给持单人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.424,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 19.522,
   "speechEnd": 23.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，签收单可以翻过来看。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，签收单可以翻过来看。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.396,
   "dur": 3.912,
   "speechStart": 24.494,
   "speechEnd": 27.458
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "钱包里的签名请求，常常只显示一串十六进制数据。",
   "spoken": "钱包里的签名请求，常常只显示一串十六进制数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.528,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 28.626,
   "speechEnd": 32.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "最容易被滥用的签名，有五类。",
   "spoken": "最容易被滥用的签名，有五类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.004,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 34.102,
   "speechEnd": 36.423
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第一类，approve，允许对方转走你某个代币，最多到一个额度。",
   "spoken": "第一类，approve，允许对方转走你某个代币，最多到一个额度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 37.464,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 37.562,
   "speechEnd": 42.062
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "它要上链，要花 Gas。",
   "spoken": "它要上链，要花 Gas。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 43.132,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 43.23,
   "speechEnd": 45.015
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第二类，permit，效果和 approve 一样，但只是一个链下签名。",
   "spoken": "第二类，permit，效果和 approve 一样，但只是一个链下签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 46.064,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 46.162,
   "speechEnd": 50.507
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "签好的消息，由别人提交上链。",
   "spoken": "签好的消息，由别人提交上链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.564,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 51.662,
   "speechEnd": 53.959
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "第三类，setApprovalForAll，对方能转走你在一个 NFT 系列里的全部 NFT。",
   "spoken": "第三类，setApprovalForAll，对方能转走你在一个 NFT 系列里的全部 NFT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 55.024,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 55.122,
   "speechEnd": 61.407
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第四类，Permit2 批量授权，一次签名，交出多种代币。",
   "spoken": "第四类，Permit2 批亮授权，一次签名，交出多种代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 62.468,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 62.566,
   "speechEnd": 67.185
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "第五类，EIP-7702 委托，你的地址去执行一份委托合约的代码。",
   "spoken": "第五类，EIP-7702 委托，你的地址去执行一份委托合约的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 68.256,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 68.354,
   "speechEnd": 74.02
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "那份代码，可以直接转走全部资产。",
   "spoken": "那份代码，可以直接转走全部资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 75.076,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 75.174,
   "speechEnd": 77.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "最危险的是链下签名，不花 Gas，钱包里也没有交易记录。",
   "spoken": "最危险的是链下签名，不花 Gas，钱包里也没有交易记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 78.92,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 79.018,
   "speechEnd": 83.256
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "你以为只是登录，其实签下一张支票。",
   "spoken": "你以为只是登录，其实签下一张支票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 84.324,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 84.422,
   "speechEnd": 87.148
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "2024 年 9 月，有人签了一个 permit，被转走约 3243 万美元的 spWETH。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 9 月，有人签了一个 permit，被转走约 3243 万美元的 spWETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.216,
   "dur": 7.248,
   "speechStart": 88.314,
   "speechEnd": 94.611
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "同年 8 月，另一名用户的签名，把金库合约的 owner 改成攻击者。",
   "spoken": "同年 8 月，另一名用户的签名，把金库合约的 owner 改成攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 95.684,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 95.782,
   "speechEnd": 100.555
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "约 20 分钟后，攻击者铸出约 5547 万美元的 DAI。",
   "spoken": "约 20 分钟后，攻击者铸出约 5547 万美元的 DAI。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 101.616,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 101.714,
   "speechEnd": 106.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "这一例不是 permit，是改 owner。",
   "spoken": "这一例不是 permit，是改 owner。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 107.044,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 107.142,
   "speechEnd": 109.606
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "链下签名不上链，也能转移资产。",
   "spoken": "链下签名不上链，也能转移资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 110.672,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 110.77,
   "speechEnd": 113.317
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "2025 年 8 月，又有两起 7702 委托钓鱼，分别约 154 万和 100 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 8 月，又有两起 7702 委托钓鱼，分别约 154 万和 100 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 114.372,
   "dur": 7.488,
   "speechStart": 114.47,
   "speechEnd": 121.017
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "也有研究者认为，这两起的根因仍是私钥泄露，委托只是让转账更快。",
   "spoken": "也有研究者认为，这两起的根因仍是私钥泄漏，委托只是让转账更快。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
   "start": 122.08,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 122.178,
   "speechEnd": 127.642
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "大额地址的签名，要在可信设备上逐字段解码。",
